{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20285","headline":"洛阳行 · 张籍","name":"洛阳行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳宫阙当中州，城上峨峨十二楼。\n翠华西去几时返，枭巢乳鸟藏蛰燕。\n御门空锁五十年，税彼农夫修玉殿。\n六街朝暮鼓冬冬，禁兵持戟守空宫。\n百官月月拜章表，驿使相续长安道。\n上阳宫树黄复绿，野豺入苑食麋鹿。\n陌上老翁双泪垂，共说武皇巡幸时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}